{"id":"word:hebrew:H8025","type":"word","title":"שָׁלַף","subtitle":"H8025 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to pull out, up or off","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שָׁלַף (H8025) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שָׁלַף (shâlaph) means to pull out, up or off First listed occurrence: 1Chr 10 4."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שָׁלַף","transliteration":"shâlaph","pronunciation":"saw-laf'","strong":"H8025","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8025","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["שֹׁ֣לֵֽף","שֹׁ֥לֵֽף","שְׁלֹ֥ף","שְׁלוּפָה֙","וַֽ/יִּשְׁלְפָ֤/הּ"],"morphs":[["HVqrmsa",9],["HVqp3ms",5],["HVqsfsa",4],["HVqv2ms",3],["HC/Vqw3ms/Sp3fs",1],["HVqrmsc",1],["HVqrmpc",1],["HC/Vqw3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to pull out, up or off","usage":"draw (off), grow up, pluck off.","full":"H8025. shalaph שָׁלַף verb draw out, off (Late Hebrew id., loosen, draw (nail, sword; Jastr); Assyrian šalâpu , pluck out , draw sword; Aramaic לְֵַף draw sword, draw off shoe, draw sword, in Lexicons remove corselet; Arabic is pass, pass away, strip, plunder , etc.); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular ׳שׁ Judg 3:22 +; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיִּשְׁלֹף Ruth 4:8 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular שְׁלֹף Judg 9:54 +; Participle active שֹׁלֵף 8:10 +, etc.; passive feminine שׁלוּפָה Num 22:23 +; — 1 draw out sword from ( מִן ) wound Judg 3:22 , compare Job 20:25 ; usually sword from sheath Judg 8:20 ; 9:54 ; 1Sam 31:4 = 1Chr 10:4 , + מִתַּעְרָהּ 1Sam 17:51 ; בְּיָדוֺ שָׁלוּפָה וְחַרְבּוֺ Num 22:23 , 31 ; Josh 5:13 (all J), 1Chr 21:16 ; elsewhere ח שֹׁלֵף ׳אִישׁ collective Judg 8:10 ; 20:2 , 15 , 17 , 46 ; 2Sam 24:9 ; 2Kin 3:26 ; 1Chr 21:5 (twice in verse), compare Judg 20:35 and ( ח ׳שְׁלֹפֵי ) 20:25 . 2 draw off sandal Ruth 4:7-8 , (compare I. חלץ 1 ; also RS K 269 Dr Deut 25:9 Bewer SK lxxvi (1903), 332 ). 3 shoot up (?), i.e. draw out blade, of grass on roof Psa 129:6 (compare Ew Bae and others); Che Dr is unsheathed (verb with subject indefinite = passive), with same meaning; Hup-Now proposes שָׁלֵם (with || in Syriac); see Ortenberg Textkrit1 K d. Ps. (1861), 30 שֶׁחָלָף , We Hpt Du חֲלֹף (as 90:5 ; 90:6 , see ׳ח 2 ).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 10 4","keyReferences":["1Chr 10 4","1Chr 21 5","1Chr 21 5","1Chr 21 16","1Sam 17 51","1Sam 31 4","2Kgs 3 26","2Sam 24 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 10 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":10,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֣לֵֽף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֥לֵֽף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלוּפָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 51","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":51,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַֽ/יִּשְׁלְפָ֤/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"1Sam 31 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":31,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 3 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֣לֵֽף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsc"},{"reference":"2Sam 24 9","book":"2Sam","chapter":24,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֣לֵֽף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"Job 20 25","book":"Job","chapter":20,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁלַף֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"Josh 5 13","book":"Josh","chapter":5,"verse":13